OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for seven padel courts at
OL,4,Aretail park
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted for seven new
OL,7,Foutdoor padel courts to be built at a
OL,8,Fretail park.
OL,10,FSoul Padel has applied to Sunderland
OL,11,FCity Council for permission to develop
OL,12,Fa vacant plot at Peel Retail Park in
OL,13,FWashington.
OL,15,FThe company said a similar plan for the
OL,16,Fsite had already been previously
OL,17,Fapproved, but they were now reducing
OL,18,Fthe number of courts from nine to seven
OL,19,Fand allowing space for extra parking.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
