OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for seven padel courts at
OL,4,Aretail park
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe site, which is currently a plot of
OL,7,Fgrassland, would also include two
OL,8,Fshipping containers to be used as a
OL,9,Fclubhouse, changing rooms and cafe bar.
